<title>USA: Alliance Capital says class action dismissed.</title>
<headline>Alliance Capital says class action dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Capital Management L.P. said Tuesday a federal court in New York granted a motion to dismiss a class-action complaint filed against the Alliance North American Government Income Trust Inc and Alliance Captial.</p>
<p>According to Alliance, the complaint, filed in January 1995, related to investments by the fund in Mexican and Argentine securities in December 1994.</p>
<p>The United States District Court for the Southern District of New York dismissed all the claims without liability, Alliance said.</p>
</text>
